# public hygiene
# --- secrets: never committed (in place from the first commit) ---
# .env itself is deliberately NOT listed: app builders like Lovable commit it with
# publishable values only, and .gitleaks.toml allows nothing else in it.
# Real keys live in the hosting platform's secret store, or locally in .env.local.
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
